Package: nparLD
Type: Package
Title: Nonparametric Analysis of Longitudinal Data in Factorial Experiments
Version: 2.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Frank", "Konietschke", email = "frank.konietschke@charite.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides nonparametric procedures for the analysis of longitudinal data in factorial experiments. The package implements tests of hypotheses on marginal distribution functions and on unweighted relative marginal effects. It supports arbitrary crossed factorial designs with longitudinal or repeated-measures factors, missing observations, dependent replicates, rank- and pseudo-rank-based inference, Wald-type and ANOVA-type statistics, multiple contrast tests, and simultaneous confidence intervals.
